OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader denies saying Long
OL,4,ACovid 'made up'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Reform UK councillor has been
OL,7,Fchallenged over a comment posted on her
OL,8,Fsocial media account claiming Long
OL,9,FCovid is a myth "made up by the media".
OL,11,FWood, who is the leader of Kirklees
OL,12,FCouncil, said the comment was "not made
OL,13,Fby me and did not reflect my personal
OL,14,Fviews, either then or now".
OL,16,FShe was asked about the post, dated 31
OL,17,FDecember 2020, by Green Party
OL,18,Fcouncillor Andrew Cooper at a council
OL,19,Fmeeting on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
