OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader denies saying Long
OL,4,ACovid 'made up'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "Do you agree with this
OL,7,Fstatement?" before reading the post
OL,8,Fwhich said: "Long Covid is not a thing.
OL,9,FIt was made up by the media. Get a
OL,10,Fgrip."
